    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new Battle Royale Game, I have played every battle royale game, and honestly, I wanted to make one myself and tailor it completely for the players, so I did. I apologize as I am the only one working on the game, my wife is pregnant and I also have a full-time job, I am releasing this in hopes to get the funds to complete this game in its entirety withing the next year or two years. I will focus heavily on all player feedback. Any cheating discovered will not be tolerated and your game license will be revoked. For me to get controller working I had to manage the game properties by right clicking the game in my library on steam, go to controller, and disable steam input.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new Battle Royale Game, I have played every battle royale game, and honestly, I wanted to make one myself and tailor it completely for the players, so I did. I apologize as I am the only one working on the game, my wife is pregnant and I also have a full-time job, I am releasing this in hopes to get the funds to complete this game in its entirety withing the next year or two years. I will focus heavily on all player feedback. Any cheating discovered will not be tolerated and your game license will be revoked. For me to get controller working I had to manage the game properties by right clicking the game in my library on steam, go to controller, and disable steam input.</p>",
